const fixT=t=>{t=String(t).trim().replace(/^[(\[*~>]+/,'').replace(/[)\],;:*]+$/g,'');if(/^[Oo]$/.test(t))return'0';if(/^[Oo](g|mg)$/i.test(t))return'0'+t.slice(1);if(/^m9$/i.test(t))return'mg';return t};
